+
+/**
+ * 6. AzGuard permission group `{panel}.{entity}.{action}`, claimed into
+ * mod_records on enable. `scopeable()` opts into the aut_role_matrix scope
+ * axis (none/own/dept/dept_tree/workspace/account).
